alism, 8k, highly detailed.\n\n\n一张数字绘画图，全景全身照，极浅景深，镜头对准一个未来主义的机器人瘫坐在地上表情失落，全身白色机甲外壳，外壳质感光滑但略有破损和有明显的划痕，细节丰富，关节处裸露出金属关节件，眼睛是两颗摄像头DIY组装的镜头 其中一个镜头玻璃破碎。环境迷雾笼罩的黄昏沙地，极具未来末日感，赛博废土风，低角度照明，AO，rim lighting, backlight, golden edge light，远处隐约从高科技的城市透露出的霓虹灯，看不清任何城市结构 只能看见透过迷雾的霓虹灯。\n\n[Tags]\ncyberpunk warrior, blood splatter, white hair, red eyes, mechanical neck gear, leather jacket, gold accents, urban street, close-up portrait, shallow depth of field, high detail render\n\n[Simple]\nA cyberpunk warrior with glowing red eyes and blood streaks stares intensely forward while wearing ornate metallic armor against a blurred city backdrop.\n\n[Detailed]\nThe subject is a male figure captured in extreme close-up, his face contorted slightly downward under intense focus, revealing sharp cheekbones dusted with dried crimson stains that cascade like rivulets down his temples toward his chin. His piercing red irises glow faintly beneath thin brows, contrasting starkly with pale skin marred by fresh cuts bleeding onto darkened lips. Wild silver-white strands of hair frame his visage asymmetrically, some pinned back with small circular earrings near pointed ears. Around his throat lies complex machinery resembling segmented metal plates fused with black rubber tubing; these components glisten subtly under ambient daylight, suggesting hydraulic movement despite stillness. He wears a deep burgundy textured leather jacket whose collar edges catch stray droplets of moisture, possibly sweat mingled with gore. Behind him, out-of-focus vertical lines suggest towering structures—likely skyscrapers—with bokeh highlights indicating bright outdoor illumination. The overall tone feels gritty yet polished due to crisp edge retention across facial features versus soft blur enveloping distant architecture.\n\n[Structured]\n1. Medium & Style: Hyper-realistic digital painting rendered with photorealistic texturing, detailed specular reflections on metal surfaces, and dramatic chiaroscuro shading emphasizing anatomical contours.\n2. Subject & Quantity: One adult human male cyborg-warrior portrayed front-facing during combat aftermath.\n3. Environment: Urban rooftop level within dystopian metropolis characterized by tall buildings partially obscured behind foreground subject’s shoulders.\n4. Lighting: Bright natural sunlight casting hard-edged shadows along jawline and forehead creases, creating strong tonal separation between lit zones and shaded recesses.\n5. Color: Dominated by warm neutrals including off-white flesh tones, matte brown leathers, fiery scarlet hues from bodily fluids, accented with cool brass-gold metallic sheens.\n6. Mood: Intense confrontation energy mixed with visceral exhaustion conveyed through dripping wounds and weary gaze directed outward.\n7. Composition & Framing: Low-angle tight headshot using wide aperture resulting in compressed plane where subject occupies central canvas space amid pronounced defocus on surrounding environmental details."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [348.47247314453125, 648.8674926757812], "pos": [95.57952117919922, 899.0330200195312], "id": 59, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [130], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["68f8db783c106db47cd5de4e3c469664c81433cff7db317f81e3a236ffc36599.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [270, 314], "pos": [1070.9923095703125, -178.17633056640625], "id": 108, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "BOOLEAN", "links