hires, emanating azure thunder. Both creatures rest their massive paws among vast piles of stacked gold coins inscribed with crowns, symbolizing dominion over wealth and power. Behind them rise monumental pillars framing royal banners—one depicting a lion’s head against scarlet cloth, the other a tiger’s visage set against deep indigo—with corresponding elemental energies swirling around them.\n\nArtistic techniques and stylistic details:\nRendered as a highly detailed fantasy digital painting, the scene employs meticulous layering of metallic surfaces, intricate filigree work along garments and armors, and precise rendering of reflective jewels embedded into fabric and plating. Composition follows symmetrical balance centered on the monarch, drawing focus through radial emphasis toward the beastly guardians who frame him like celestial sentinels. Coloration utilizes opulent golds for warmth and dominance, contrasted sharply with vibrant red and cobalt electrical discharges suggesting raw natural forces or divine wrath; all elements exhibit painterly depth via luminous highlights and soft shadows sculpted across forms.\n\nVisual effects and atmosphere:\nIntense directional illumination originates from above and behind, casting volumetric beams onto the figures’ faces and limbs while leaving recesses in armor and folds beneath dimmer ambient light; this creates strong three-dimensional presence despite flatness inherent in stylized design. Surface textures range from smooth velvet drapes and polished metal plates to roughened fur tufts and sharp claw tips—all vividly defined with micro-detail fidelity. The emotional ambiance conveys awe-inspiring majesty tempered by primal ferocity—the king calm yet surrounded by untamed chaos—and evokes themes of absolute sovereignty fused with supernatural might, grounded firmly in classical epic aesthetics."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 134, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id":